//! Native AI request / runtime adapter foundation and managed local LiteRT lifecycle.
//!
//! Provides:
//! - Bounded child-process lifecycle state machine for the local MiniCPM5 LiteRT-LM server
//!   (`litert_lifecycle.rs`), matching `desktop/litert-server.ts`.
//! - Provider configuration, server-held credential isolation, feature routing, and temperature
//!   defaults (`provider_types.rs`), matching `src/utils/ai-client.ts`.
//! - Request identity, manuscript revision guarding, bounded queues, and thread-safe cancellation
//!   (`request.rs`).
//! - Generation stream accumulator, reasoning tags processing, and snapshot transitions
//!   (`stream_accumulator.rs`), matching `generation-stream.ts` and `reasoning-tags.ts`.
//! - Structured output parsing for Rubric judges and research targets (`contract_extractors.rs`),
//!   matching `llm-parsing.ts` and `research-targets.ts`.
//! - Zero-dependency loopback HTTP/1.1 and Server-Sent Events client (`loopback_transport.rs`).
//! - Central NativeAiCoordinator (`coordinator.rs`) managing lifecycle, dispatch, and keystroke isolation.

